"entity": {
"name": "Ventive Hospitality Limited",
"description": "Ventive Hospitality Ltd. engages in the development and management of hospitality assets. Its assets include JW Marriott, The Ritz-Carlton, Conrad, Anantara, and Raaya by Atmosphere. It also handles office parks and retail stores. The company was founded in 2002 and is headquartered in Pune, India.",
